@AeroGraph.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5243

### Import summary
GET {{AeroGraph.Api_HostAddress}}/stats

### One airport
GET {{AeroGraph.Api_HostAddress}}/airports/TLS

### Search by code, name or city
GET {{AeroGraph.Api_HostAddress}}/airports?search=paris&limit=5

### Direct flights from an airport
GET {{AeroGraph.Api_HostAddress}}/airports/TLS/destinations

### Fewest-stops trip (Toulouse to Nouméa: 2 stops)
GET {{AeroGraph.Api_HostAddress}}/routes?from=TLS&to=NOU

### Trip with a stop limit (404 when even the shortest trip has more stops)
GET {{AeroGraph.Api_HostAddress}}/routes?from=TLS&to=NOU&maxStops=1

### 404: unknown airport
GET {{AeroGraph.Api_HostAddress}}/airports/ZZZ

### 400: badly formed code
GET {{AeroGraph.Api_HostAddress}}/airports/TOULOUSE
